interfaces/**/working
interfaces/**/test

# G0's C48 configuration is tracked; the example* rule above would ignore it.
#
# 'applications/**/example*/' ignores the whole directory, not just its
# contents, and git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded -- so the directory has to be un-ignored before the mesh file inside
# it can be ignored again. Both lines are needed and the order is not free.
#
# example/ is unaffected: its files are already tracked, and a tracked file
# stays tracked whatever .gitignore says.
!applications/gungho_model/example_C48/
applications/gungho_model/example_C48/*.nc
